      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a crisis management plan for my company. We're getting hammered on social media right now because we haven't taken a stance on the new [Proposed Climate Accountability Act / or similar controversial policy]. Some of our core customers are calling us out for being silent, but our older demographic might bail if we get too political. Can you do a deep dive into the pros and cons of us issuing a formal statement in support of the policy vs. just staying neutral? I need to see the strategic implications for our brand image.",
