      "content": "I hear you, but you're basically saying there's no valid strategic reason to stay neutral. What about the risk of being seen as \"woke\" or politically motivated by a huge chunk of our customer base? Isn't there an argument that a company should stick to its core business and avoid being seen as an activist group?",
